-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>nature</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Director</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>demeanor</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Architect</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>generation</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">5th</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>embrace</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">31 CE</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>apparent age</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Late 30s</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>physical</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Strength 5, Dexterity 5, Stamina 8</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>social</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Charisma 7, Manipulation 5, Appearance 6</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>mental</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Perception 5, Intelligence 7, Wits 6</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>talents</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Acting 6, Alertness 5, Athletics 5, Brawl 5, Dodge 4, Empathy 2, Intimidation 6, Leadership 6, Streetwise 2, Subterfuge 5</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>skills</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Animal Ken 4, Crafts (Repair) 2, Drive 1, Etiquette 3, Melee 6, Security 1, Stealth 3, Survival 4</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>knowledges</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Bureaucracy 5, Finance 2, Investigation 2, Law 4, Linguistics 5, Medicine 1, Occult 5, Politics 6, Science 1</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>disciplines</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Auspex 5, Celerity 4, Dominate 5, Fortitude 5, Obfuscate 6, Obtenebration 5, Potence 4, Presence 7, Protean 5, Thaumaturgy 5, Vicissitude 3</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>thaumaturgical paths</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Lure of Flames 5, Movement of the Mind 5, Weather Control 5</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>backgrounds</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Allies 6, Contacts 8, Fame 1, Influence 8, Resources 6, Retainers 5, Status 6</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>virtues</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Conscience 2, Self-Control 5, Courage 5</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>morality</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Humanity 2</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>willpower</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">10</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:rubik\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>source</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">VTM: D.C. by Night, p. 84-86</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> Tho' I guess since DC by Night he learned a trick or two<br /> In Beckett's Jyhad Diary Bell and Beckett discovered that Vitel not only survived, but had subtly gathering allies among the local Sabbat, including the influential Templar Talley. And Vitel claimed to have fled into the Abyss, leaving a simulacrum of blood and shadow that was destroyed by Bell and his allies. This sounds like some Abyss mysticism ritual to me...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23890,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","user":"Shadeprowler","date":". 07-02-2022, 02:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-02T21:37:14-07:00","id":1485678,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1484583-secret-lasombra?p=1485629#post1485629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What was Marcus Vital generation? Was he a member of the 5th or 6th generation?</div> </div> </div> </div>5th, no Diablerie. His sire, Sybil, was a direct childe of [Lasombra].<br /> <br /> That's a big part of the success of his &quot;guise&quot;: he was a 5th gen, 2 millennia-old Roman official that barely had any contact with his own sire, posing as a 5th gen, 2 millennia-old Roman official that barely had any contact with his own sire.<br /> <br /> Powerful, old, embraced by a legend, access to 8th level powers, a low profile life until then, and it is really hard to stress too much how much Vitel's purported identity actually matches his identity.<br /> <br /> Heck, at this point he could just <i>say he thought he was Ventrue all along</i> and that wold fly, no problem. Who's to say Sybil told him the truth two thousand years ago at the margins of a river where we can't be sure she spent more than a few nights with her childe?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-02T22:23:40-07:00","id":1485682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1484583-secret-lasombra?p=1485678#post1485678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's a big part of the success of his &quot;guise&quot;: he was a 5th gen, 2 millennia-old Roman official that barely had any contact with his own sire, posing as a 5th gen, 2 millennia-old Roman official that barely had any contact with his own sire.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Imho, this is Infiltration 101; keep it simple and don't overcomplicate things. ^^<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1484583-secret-lasombra?p=1485678#post1485678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Heck, at this point he could just <i>say he thought he was Ventrue all along</i> and that wold fly, no problem. Who's to say Sybil told him the truth two thousand years ago at the margins of a river where we can't be sure she spent more than a few nights with her childe?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>How true<br /> Not to mention, the Camarilla, at the end of the day, is always practical and quite pragmatic<br /> &quot;Eh, okay, maybe he is a Lasombra, but did a pretty good job as a Ventrue Prince&quot;<br /> Like in the old joke:<br /> <br /> A professor is sent to darkest Africa to live with a primitive tribe. He spends years with them, teaching them reading, writing, math and science. One day the wife of the tribe's chief gives birth to a white child. The tribe is shocked, and the chief pulls the professor aside and says, &quot;Look here! You're the only white man we've ever seen and this woman gives birth to a white child. It doesn't take a genius to figure out what happened!&quot; The professor replied, &quot;No, Chief. You're mistaken. What you have here is a natural occurrence, what we in the civilized world call an albino! Look at that field over there. All of the sheep are white except for one black one. Nature does this on occasion.&quot; The chief was silent for a moment, then said, &quot;Ok, ok, you no tell anyone, I no tell anyone.&quot;<br /> <br /> Lasombra? Venture?<br /> You no tell anyone, I no tell anyone","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-03T06:59:10-07:00","id":1485687,"title":"","content":"There's no law against a Lasombra being Prince, by the way. Vitel is one of the reasons &quot;Ventrue Prince&quot; became a thing when the core book originally intended it to be the exception. It makes some sense, but wouldn't be exceedingly problematic once he reached power, as long as he could deflate suspicions of him not being a proper Camarilla Prince.<br /> <br /> Otherwise... that's a really bad joke, in many levels.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-03T10:55:05-07:00","id":1485704,"title":"","content":"What was Marcus Vitel reasons for posing as a member of another clan?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-03T14:42:01-07:00","id":1485720,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1484583-secret-lasombra?p=1485704#post1485704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What was Marcus Vitel reasons for posing as a member of another clan?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ease of becoming Prince of Washington DC.<br /> <br /> Like, really just that. He was ambitious and wanted to be Prince of an important city. If he assumed his own past and identity that would be harder to achieve.<br /> <br /> He had been Sabbat in the past, but abandoned the sect early, so the tie wouldn't damn him too much or anything, it would just make him too standard a Lasombra to be likely to achieve his goals in the time he wanted, specially when his eyes were in a globally relevant city.<br /> <br /> There was more to his story and personality, but not to the ruse itself. He was otherwise exactly what he appeared to be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-08T11:30:15-07:00","id":1486053,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the answers about Vitel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-15T21:25:48-07:00","id":1486581,"title":"","content":"To be honest one reason to send Lasombra as infiltraitos, if we're going by general stereotype, is that Lasombra are plentiful in the Sabbat and probably have a higher percentage of people with the skills and characteristics to pull it off as opposed to the Tzimisce freaks and various Sabbat hooligans.<br /> <br /> A Brujah Antitribu with enough brains and discipline to do an infiltraiton would be nice. But how many of those are around a given city and can be sent on this kind of mission?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/970-gurkhal","name":"Gurkhal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"863"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-16T09:06:41-07:00","id":1486627,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gurkhal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1484583-secret-lasombra?p=1486581#post1486581\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be honest one reason to send Lasombra as infiltraitos, if we're going by general stereotype, is that Lasombra are plentiful in the Sabbat and probably have a higher percentage of people with the skills and characteristics to pull it off as opposed to the Tzimisce freaks and various Sabbat hooligans.<br /> <br /> A Brujah Antitribu with enough brains and discipline to do an infiltraiton would be nice. But how many of those are around a given city and can be sent on this kind of mission?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I get your point. But the Brujah are capable of being disciplined for infiltration if it there passion and serves there goals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://